    "confirm_double_talk": "User speech during playback should confirm when the near-end evidence is sufficient.",
    "reject_non_speech": "Background conversation, music, or short impulses without the scripted user speech must not confirm.",
    "degraded_reference": "Missing or discontinuous reference must be observable and must not be treated as healthy echo evidence."
  },
